cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "AeroGuard: Physics-Informed Machine Learning for Multi-Second Aircraft Stall Early Warning and Cross-Mechanism Generalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bulusu"
    given-names: "Hanusharan"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-12"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22724022"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hanusharan/AeroGuard"
url: "https://hanusharan.github.io/AeroGuard/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A simulation-only research pipeline (2D longitudinal flight-dynamics simulator,
  versioned trajectory datasets, temporal ML early-warning model) testing whether
  a multi-second stall precursor can be predicted and whether that skill transfers
  across control-input mechanisms. Preprint; not peer-reviewed, not flight-tested.
keywords:
  - stall warning
  - machine learning
  - flight dynamics
  - early warning
  - simulation
